WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,360
first question

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:08,160
We need to help you complete a few things

3
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:12,820
Then how many or three pieces can you tell me?

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,160
Three pieces is three pieces

5
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,080
Three things can ruin a relationship

6
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,040
If it were me, I probably wouldn't even bring a counter-offer.

7
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,400
Will there be a fatal mission?

8
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:23,550
Why do you ask?

9
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:25,590
The arrogant rabbit died and the lackey was cooked

10
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,310
Birds enter the cool palace to hide

11
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,510
This is not the truth since time immemorial

12
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:32,230
The arrogant rabbit died and the lackey was cooked

13
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:35,830
Don't worry when flying birds enter the cool palace to hide

14
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,790
Wei is not that kind of person

15
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:39,790
Although what I asked you to do is very dangerous

16
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:41,990
But I will never deliberately trap you.

17
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:44,350
Brother, what you said is so good.

18
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,110
It's a shame you're on death row.

19
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:47,510
You should go to the examiner

20
00:00:47,510 --> 00:00:50,950
Maybe if you're lucky, you can become a consort

21
00:00:50,950 --> 00:01:02,150
Do you have any questions? No, Shen San.

22
00:01:02,510 --> 00:01:05,110
I advise you to be careful and rest assured

23
00:01:05,110 --> 00:01:06,510
Just a little guy

24
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:07,790
I have the piano in my hand
